## Scope

Follow [zotero/document-worker#33](https://github.com/zotero/document-worker/pull/33)
after submission by ticket 0679. Read the PR page for maintainer response and
CI, make requested changes on the fork branch, and record the upstream outcome.
`SYNC.md` owns the live status; this ticket owns the work and its evidence.

## Remaining verification from 0679

- Extend differential tests to malformed references, empty indexes and index
  construction/mutation; the submitted focused test covers normal roots,
  nested blocks and NaN.
- Count work while varying both bibliography runs and eligible blocks, then
  compare decoded native packs on identical fixtures and measure citation-stage
  time without claiming a whole-pipeline bound.
- Run the document-worker suite when its dependencies are available.

## Exit criteria

The PR has an upstream disposition, requested revisions are resolved, and the
verification above has a recorded result or a specific, honest not-run reason.
If merged, confirm the fix in the upstream head or release before closing.
